#netlist pseudocode

net Vin # 12V supply from carbattery
net Gnd

component F1; fuse 10A automotive
component M1; 15A mechanical ammeter

net Vfused

connect Vin F1[1] 
connect F1[2] M1[1] 
connect M1[2] Vfused

component K1; SPDT relay 5-12V coil 50A 60V contacts
component D1, D2; 100V 2A Si
component SW1; SPST toggle switch
component SW2; SPST button

net Vout

connect Vfused K1[com]
connect Vfused K1[coil1]
connect K1[coil2] D1[a]
connect D1[k] K1[coil1]
connect K1[coil2] D2[a] #only allows current to flow through the coil if the supply has the correct polarity, the voltage drop is not an issue because K1 reliably works with as low as 9V.
connect D2[k] SW1[1]
connect SW1[2] SW2[1]
connect SW2[2] Gnd

connect K1[no] Vout

component VR1; 10k trim pot
component R1; 220R .25W resistor
component D3; 5mm red LED
component FAN1; 12V brushless fan

connect VR1[end1] Vout
connect VR1[wiper] VR1[end2]
connect R1[1] VR1[end2]
connect R1[2] D3[a]
connect D3[k] Gnd

connect FAN1[pos] Vout
connect FAN1[neg] Gnd 
